      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `e62c23e9b7d18328fd8ee5df896b49ee47224e750bc76a6adf1e5610b23a27aa--recorded-crime-offenders-2021-22-cube-5-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Offenders (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2021\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | d331889b897afed1ab068c3c8d23fd40a2eff6e7e6cc6be28ac77e08dc75eb74 | missing |\n| \"Table 27\" | 397fc44a9ede0830b8569ebade99532de2b1deb84211ac81791f1bf6ecbef37d | missing |\n| \"Table 28\" | d9e593122232ff5b6f0cf80b2f5f50b550ddd8414c967dfb8b3100dc40328bdd | missing |\n| \"Table 29\" | 3d3ce3c0babce89a742776773ad88c296ab78515d545be956e56680185c8812a | missing |\n| \"Table 30\" | 963ff6f3e6ff02d2dc2751b7b22720585c35eee45248b4af410d151a5a202d9d | missing |\n| \"Table 31\" | 7ec76027f21ccc46805f033386b319d238a09922dfead7a65194e0db64bb00a3 | missing |\n| \"Table 32\" | 9f91cbcb54f783bfb0d56245050bd1c6beacb37dddccae1eea67c91e382de9c3 | missing |\n| \"Table 33\" | e3d127d714037e7f44235a98a88849d8c14d2f17fabb2990515e91d1afeeefcb | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
